      "message": "Sorry ahead of time for giant CL.\n\nFor an easier review, here are some important areas to functions:\n* socket_listen (common api for creating a listening socket)\n* socket_connect (common api for creating a connecting socket)\n* listening_task (task that runs in tokio that polls the socket for new connections)\n* connecting_task (task that runs in tokio that handles connection results)\n\nMost of the api surface comes from Android with some adaptations for the RPC format we have.\n\nIf you need additional context, I can update the design doc at go/floss-socket-manager with additional details on how the implementation works.",
